&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注) 金額は外注を含み、実際原価で表示しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
